OL,3,GNEWSADecision due on first council tax
OL,4,Achanges in 23 years for Welsh homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is set to announce
OL,7,Fwhether a major revaluation of homes
OL,8,Fwill happen, following uncertainty over
OL,9,Fwhether ministers will go ahead with
OL,10,Fplanned changes to council tax.
OL,12,FReforms that were postponed in 2024
OL,13,Festimated that 800,000 homes could see
OL,14,Fcuts in council tax bills, and that
OL,15,F470,000 of the most expensive
OL,16,Fproperties could see increases.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
