OL,3,GNEWSADecision due on first council tax
OL,4,Achanges in 23 years for Welsh homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh Conservatives called for the
OL,7,Frevaluation to be scrapped, saying it
OL,8,Fcould increase bills for struggling
OL,9,Ffamilies, while Welsh Labour said not
OL,10,Fgoing ahead with it would call into
OL,11,Fquestion "Plaid's progressive values".
OL,13,FFinance Minister Elin Jones is expected
OL,14,Fto update the Senedd on the
OL,15,Fgovernment's plans on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
